        "contenuto_esteso": "France's ex-president Nicolas Sarkozy on Tuesday told an appeal trial there was \"not a single cent of Libyan money\" in the campaign that saw him elected in 2007. The 71-year-old, who has always denied any wrongdoing, last year became modern France's first former president to have gone to jail over the case. FRANCE 24's Antonia Kerrigan reports."
